MagicMissile: steered by the cursor while held; let go, it seeks an enemy within 800 px
Flamelash: steered by the cursor while held; let go, it seeks an enemy within 800 px
RainbowRod: steered by the cursor while held; let go, it seeks an enemy within 800 px
BeeGun: the bees chase an enemy within 800 px soon after launch
WaspGun: the wasps chase an enemy within 800 px soon after launch
BatScepter: the bats chase an enemy within 800 px soon after launch
PossessedHatchet: the hatchet flies at an enemy within 800 px
BouncingShield: the shield flies at an enemy within 800 px
ChlorophyteBullet: turns toward an enemy within 300 px in sight
BookofSkulls: the skull turns gently toward an enemy within 300 px
SpectreStaff: the lost soul flies at an enemy within 400 px
SnowmanCannon: the rockets turn toward an enemy within 600 px
Flairon: the bubbles it spews home in within 650 px
RazorbladeTyphoon: each wheel locks onto an enemy within 500 px in sight
VortexBeater: only the rocket every seventh shot homes; the bullets fly straight
NebulaArcanum: the orb seeks an enemy within 800 px once it slows down
NebulaBlaze: turns toward an enemy within 250 px (the strong shot 500 px)
SpiritFlame: the flame flies at an enemy within 500 px
Celeb2: only one of its seven rocket kinds homes
FairyQueenMagicItem: the shots turn toward an enemy within 800 px for most of their flight
WeatherPain: the shot flies at an enemy within 400 px in sight
FrostyFlare: the stealth flare drops phantom flares that home in within 400 px
